\f0\b\fs22 \cf2 PeeBee
\f1\b0  is a speculative design concept for a network of autonomous toilet vehicles that reimagines the provision of public sanitation facilities in cities. In light of the shortage of free, accessible toilets in German cities, PeeBee offers a mobile, on-demand solution. The vehicles are distributed across the city and can be used directly or requested via an app. Usage is free of charge and is funded through public subsidies as well as the sale of recycled urine and humus, which are applied directly to fields by the vehicles themselves as fertiliser. }